# Marlin-scoped presets (delivered via 92-variant-customizations.sh).
#
# Arch ships a disable-all default preset, and first-boot preset policy
# deletes enablement symlinks for units no preset names (see the shared
# 50-tunaos.preset header for the measured mechanism). These two units are
# enabled by 40-services.sh's pacman branch, so they are named here to
# preserve exactly what the build intends — scoped to marlin so no other
# variant's first-boot policy changes.
enable bluetooth.service
enable uupd.timer
